<title>GERMANY: CAMELS TO RACE IN BERLIN.</title>
<headline>CAMELS TO RACE IN BERLIN.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jockeys put around 25 camels through their paces on Tuesday ahead of the first race on a European track.</p>
<p>The camels, loaned by United Arab Emirates President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan, were exercised close to the Hoppegarten course where the race is to be held on August 14.</p>
